{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3906310/extras/e5711aa3225e0cb5e0f602ca1d3130d6.avif?t=1754311136\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">VibeDash is a fast-paced sci-fi runner built for speed, precision, and adrenaline. Dash through neon-lit ruins and crumbling structures as a cyber-enhanced runner in a high-stakes world. Perfect your moves, master the flow, and chase the ultimate run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>&quot;Run fast. Think faster. The world won\u2019t wait.&quot;</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3906310/extras/f15b68db664550856f626c6e13a53d4a.avif?t=1754311136\" /></div></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Built-in speedrun mode with global leaderboards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Tight controls and fast-paced parkour mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Rare and challenging achievements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Sci-fi synthwave soundtrack</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Stylized visuals with a dystopian neon vibe</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3906310/extras/a391731a4df3545695eb60d5fd7895e2.avif?t=1754311136\" /></div></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Whether you're a casual player, speedrunner, or achievement hunter\u2014VibeDash has something for you. Compete against the clock with built-in speedrun timers, unlock rare achievements, and test your reflexes in challenging environments designed for high replayability.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3906310?t=1754311136","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/s